                "typeName": "Abilities",
                "characteristics": [
                  {
                    "name": "Description",
                    "$text": "- **Storm Hawk Gunships** gain the dedicated transport keyword\n- You can use **Rapid Ingress** twice per battle round and it can be used in turn 1\n- You may put up to all your army in **deep strike**\n- All **Infantry** units must be withing a **transport** if they do not have the **jumpack** keyword\n- All **Jumpack** models must be in **deep strike** at the start of the game\n- You can not bring any non-**fly** vehicles or **fortifications**",
                    "typeId": "9b8f-694b-e5e-b573"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
